OL,3,GNEWSAHospital managers seek to boost
OL,4,Alow staff morale
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospital managers have "absolutely
OL,7,Facknowledged that morale has dipped"
OL,8,Famid efforts to manage a #49.3m deficit
OL,9,Fand said they are working to improve
OL,10,Fit.
OL,12,FThe Royal Cornwall Hospitals NHS Trust
OL,13,F(RCHT) announced proposals last year to
OL,14,Fcut about 150 administrative roles but
OL,15,Flater confirmed "compulsory
OL,16,Fredundancies" were off the table.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
