OL,3,GNEWSAHospital managers seek to boost
OL,4,Alow staff morale
OL,5,
OL,6,FKim O'Keefe, acting chief executive of
OL,7,Fthe Royal Cornwall Hospitals Trust,
OL,8,Fsaid her team saw "a small number of
OL,9,Fstaff leave" during the clinical admin
OL,10,Freview, in which the trust consulted
OL,11,Fwith about 500 people.
OL,13,FShe noted it had been "holding
OL,14,Fvacancies" to "make sure nobody was
OL,15,Fmade redundant" and 60 jobs were
OL,16,Fcurrently being advertised under the
OL,17,Ftrust.
